<title>NEW ZEALAND: NZ's Qpod Systems to announce public share offer.</title>
<headline>NZ's Qpod Systems to announce public share offer.</headline>
<dateline>WELLINGTON 1996-10-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>New Zealand-based food storage and transport technology company Qpod Systems Ltd said on Monday it planned to issue a prospectus on Tuesday for a public share offering.</p>
<p>The offering will be in Australia and New Zealand. No further details were available.</p>
<p>-- Wellington newsroom 64 4 4734 746</p>
</text>
